but in the expansion

00:06:48.079 --> 00:06:50.019
and the edge of what that universe is,

00:06:50.019 --> 00:06:51.704
you have no way to interact with it.

00:06:51.704 --> 00:06:54.484
So there you have it.
- Wow.

00:06:54.484 --> 00:06:56.141
- We're stuck in this one.
- We're stuck in this one,

00:06:56.141 --> 00:06:56.974
and that's all there is to it.

00:06:56.974 --> 00:06:58.836
That's pretty wild.

00:06:58.836 --> 00:07:00.673
Man, that's a, well, listen.

00:07:00.673 --> 00:07:02.083
- He got his money's worth on that one.

00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:02.994
