that's weird, why is that?"

00:07:24.162 --> 00:07:29.162
No, no one has ever been at a
place unless it was at a time.

00:07:31.415 --> 00:07:33.757
No one has ever acknowledged a time

00:07:33.757 --> 00:07:36.084
